oud will cast you down to the 2nd level of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think you see where this is going? Yes, 7 levels of death. Each level challenging you with a completely different style and genre of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/0dd3bfd6506012257caf1ae8f9a1280c.poster.avif?t=1766242693\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/0dd3bfd6506012257caf1ae8f9a1280c.webm?t=1766242693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/0dd3bfd6506012257caf1ae8f9a1280c.mp4?t=1766242693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/67c6f8ecebb383b4738c5017f6e48883.avif?t=1766242693\" width=480 height=270 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2nd level of death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble your way through an electrified maze all while racing against the clock. Every time you touch an electric wall your time will be reduced. Caution! if you touch the red laser beams you die instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/46f7f8721156d0c539d91255c0eadde1.poster.avif?t=1766242693\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472170/extras/46f7f8721156d0c539d91255c0eadde1.webm?t=1766242693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 